    "description": "AI Assistance Disclosure: Tool: Claude Code (model: Claude Opus 5.5), date: 2026-10-11. Scope: generated this collection from the routes and error codes in credit-service/AGENTS.md. Author review: pending — Jian Bing to record what he checked.\n\nRequests for the Credit Service's internal routes, which only the Order Service calls. They go straight to the service on port 3004, not through the gateway.\n\nSETUP: set the serviceKey collection variable to CREDIT_SERVICE_KEY from your .env, and start the service with `docker compose up -d credit-service`.\n\nRUN each folder top to bottom (or with the Collection Runner). The first request of each folder makes fresh ids, so folders can be re-run any number of times. A new user starts with 10 credits."
